WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.611
Last page! Let’s crack my secret code!

2
00:00:04.811 --> 00:00:09.641
Read each quiz, circle the best answer, and write its letter in the box.

3
00:00:09.961 --> 00:00:12.190
Do your three letters spell P I P?

4
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.302
Quiz 1. Fall leaves turn yellow because they have…

5
00:00:17.622 --> 00:00:19.526
T: more chlorophyll.

6
00:00:19.846 --> 00:00:21.889
P: less chlorophyll.

7
00:00:22.209 --> 00:00:23.881
S: more sunlight.

8
00:00:30.331 --> 00:00:31.957
It’s P, less chlorophyll!

9
00:00:33.157 --> 00:00:37.893
Quiz 2. AI changes its guess after Photo B. What now?

10
00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:40.082
E: Trust the new guess.

11
00:00:40.402 --> 00:00:42.306
I: Check a guidebook.

12
00:00:48.756 --> 00:00:50.428
It’s I, check a guidebook!

13
00:00:51.628 --> 00:00:55.064
Quiz 3. Which leaf clues showed up in your leaf rubbing?

14
00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:57.345
N: The leaf’s smell.

15
00:00:57.665 --> 00:00:59.012
O: The tree’s name.

16
00:00:59.332 --> 00:01:01.515
P: Outline and veins.

17
00:01:07.965 --> 00:01:09.915
It’s P, outline and veins!

18
00:01:11.115 --> 00:01:17.385
P… I… P! That’s me! You did it, Leaf Detective!

19
00:01:17.585 --> 00:01:19.953
Great job, detectives. See you next time!
